00:35:24.840 --> 00:35:27.760
Yeah, the cross platform
will work just fine.

00:35:27.760 --> 00:35:32.760
Do these templates allow
for background images?

00:35:32.760 --> 00:35:37.890
Yes, you can put images
on the template there.

00:35:37.890 --> 00:35:39.540
That will work.

00:35:39.540 --> 00:35:43.140
Can you custom-- can use a
custom layout that is not one

00:35:43.140 --> 00:35:44.670
